{"id":"bigote","lemma":"bigote","pos":"noun","rank":2989,"glosses":["moustache, mustache; moustaches, mustaches","whisker, whiskers (used when it's large and thick) (often in plural)"],"ipa":"/biˈɡote/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bigotes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-bigote.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él se retorció el bigote.","en":"He twirled his mustache.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639895","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"A las mujeres les gustan los hombres con bigote.","en":"Women like men with mustaches.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590278","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"woman","l":"mujer"},{"g":"them"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"man","l":"hombre"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Un beso sin bigote es como una sopa sin sal.","en":"A kiss without a mustache is like a bowl of soup with no salt.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/517942","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"kiss"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,null,{"g":"without"},{"g":"salt"}],"phrases":[[5,8,"synonym of hecho una…"]]},{"text":"Se afeitó el bigote.","en":"He shaved his mustache off.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/943459","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to shave","l":"afeitar"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Sus bigotes postizos empezaron a despegarse de un lado.","en":"His fake moustache started to peel off on one side.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"false, artificial","l":"postizo"},{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"side"}]}]}